#: ../../zh/triton_api/Debug_Ops/device_print.md:5
msgid ""
"`device_print` 用于在NPU运行时从设备端打印信息，与`static_print`不同，这是在内核执行时实时输出信息。 "
"**使用`device_print`需要将环境变量`TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT`的值设置为`True`。**"
msgstr ""
"`device_print` is used to print information from the device during NPU "
"runtime. Unlike `static_print`, this outputs information in real-time during"
" kernel execution. **Using `device_print` requires setting the environment "
"variable `TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT` to `True`.**"

