msgid "Ascend 对比 GPU 缺失uint8、uint16、uint32、uint64、fp64的支持能力（硬件限制）。"
msgstr ""
"Ascend lacks support for uint8, uint16, uint32, uint64, fp64 compared to GPU"
" (hardware limitation)."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Debug_Ops/device_print.md:44
msgid "**DevicePrint 功能限制**"
msgstr "**DevicePrint Feature Limitations**"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Debug_Ops/device_print.md:46
msgid "**现象描述：** device_print 只能打印参与运算的结果值，无法打印纯粹用于访存的 offset 变量。"
msgstr ""
"**Phenomenon Description:** device_print can only print result values "
"involved in computation, but cannot print offset variables used purely for "
"memory access."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Debug_Ops/device_print.md:49
msgid "**根本原因：** 在访存分析优化阶段，编译器会将仅用于地址计算的 offset 优化掉，这些中间变量不会保留到最终的执行代码中。"
msgstr ""
"**Root Cause:** During the memory access analysis optimization phase, the "
"compiler eliminates offsets used only for address calculation; these "
"intermediate variables are not retained in the final execution code."

