msgstr "**Example Scenarios:**"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Debug_Ops/device_print.md:71
msgid "另外在特定情况下，`device_print`会展开一些辅助dma代码，导致底层报错，相关功能还在优化中"
msgstr ""
"Additionally, in certain cases, `device_print` may expand some auxiliary DMA"
" code, causing underlying errors. This feature is still being optimized."

